        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0D9488', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>盯着屏幕久了，<br />人会习惯性硬撑。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#0B1220', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>视疲劳、肩颈僵硬，都是慢性的。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#0B1220', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不是靠意志力，而是靠一个提醒。</Text>
            <Box style={{ padding: '18px 22px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.16)', border: '1px solid rgba(13,148,136,0.35)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
